{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議，下星期在深圳舉行。深圳的現代物流業發展蓬勃，深圳港是全球第四大港口。<br/>\n<br/>\n其中，位於東南面的鹽田港，營運近100條國際航綫，當中53條聯通APEC成員經濟體。負責人說，即使國際局勢多變，都有信心保障供應鏈穩定，智慧碼頭建設、海鐵聯運、深港合作，亦能提升航運效率。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯︰黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.190660+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:01:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:10:00.033606+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:03.362188+00:00","content_hash":"662cc18875f1d3ed7d327a38ed11d944039208a54b329a2d22544ca8bab24ce4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}